$ kubectl apply -f crd-v1alpha1.yaml
customresourcedefinition.apiextensions.k8s.io/shortybackups.shorty.example.com created
$ kubectl get crd shortybackups.shorty.example.com
NAME                               SCOPE        VERSIONS            CREATED AT
shortybackups.shorty.example.com   Namespaced   v1alpha1(storage)   2026-10-28T07:34:10Z
$ kubectl api-resources | grep shortybackups
shortybackups                       sb                                shorty.example.com/v1alpha1       true         ShortyBackup
$ kubectl explain shortybackup.spec
GROUP:      shorty.example.com
KIND:       ShortyBackup
VERSION:    v1alpha1

FIELD: spec <Object>


DESCRIPTION:
    <empty>
FIELDS:
  database	<string> -required-
  enum: postgres
    备份哪个数据库；目前只支持 postgres。

  retentionDays	<integer>
    备份保留天数。
